ADDITIONAL NOTICE — READ BEFORE USING WITH REAL ASSETS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software is an unaudited TESTNET MVP with a CUSTODIAL key model.
It has NOT been reviewed by an independent security auditor. The authors
strongly discourage using it to hold, transfer or manage real funds of any
kind. Mainnet operation is disabled by default (ALLOW_MAINNET=false) and
must not be enabled without a full security audit, KMS/HSM key management,
a production database, rate limiting and legal/KYC-AML review.
